          "docs": "This endpoint is used to check all pending orders made by users, displaying orders that are awaiting execution in the market.\n\n**Pending order management features:**\n- Active orders showing all LIMIT and STOP orders awaiting execution\n- Order specifications including trigger prices and expiration dates\n- Complete order details for user review\n\nThis endpoint supports comprehensive order management by monitoring all pending orders across user portfolios, tracking order expiration dates and renewal"
        },
        {
